{"seq":2,"slug":"time-varying-covariates","title":"时变协变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/practice/time-varying-covariates","wordCount":1414,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"时变协变量\">时变协变量</h1><p>标准 Cox 模型把每个协变量当成入组时拍下的一张快照：年龄 55、剂量 200mg、血压 140，然后假设它们在整个随访期都不变。可现实里，剂量会调整、血压会波动、用户的活跃度会随月份起落、移植患者会在某天真正接受手术。把这些随时间改变的量硬塞成一个固定值，要么丢失信息，要么——更糟——引入一种叫不朽时间偏倚的严重错误。时变协变量（time-varying covariates）就是让模型吸收「协变量随时间变化」的技术。这一篇讲清数据该怎么组织、模型怎么扩展、以及与之共用同一套数据结构的左截断和地标分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>处理时变协变量的钥匙，是把数据从「每人一行」改成「每人多行」的计数过程（counting process）格式，也叫区间格式。每一行描述一个个体在某个时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>start</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>stop</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t_{\\text{start}}, t_{\\text{stop}}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">start</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 内的状态：这段时间里协变量取什么值、区间结束时是否发生了事件。当协变量改变，就为该个体新开一行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[宽格式: 每人一行&lt;br/&gt;协变量是入组快照] --&gt; B[转换]&#10;  B --&gt; C[长格式 / 计数过程&lt;br/&gt;每人多行]&#10;  C --&gt; D[每行: id, start, stop, 协变量值, event]&#10;  D --&gt; E[协变量改变时新开一行]&#10;  D --&gt; F[event 仅最后一行可为 1]&#10;  E --&gt; G[扩展 Cox&lt;br/&gt;风险集按当前区间的协变量值算]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[宽格式: 每人一行&lt;br/&gt;协变量是入组快照] --&gt; B[转换]\n  B --&gt; C[长格式 / 计数过程&lt;br/&gt;每人多行]\n  C --&gt; D[每行: id, start, stop, 协变量值, event]\n  D --&gt; E[协变量改变时新开一行]\n  D --&gt; F[event 仅最后一行可为 1]\n  E --&gt; G[扩展 Cox&lt;br/&gt;风险集按当前区间的协变量值算]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>举例：一位患者第 0 到 30 天剂量 100mg，第 30 天调到 200mg，第 50 天发生事件。这在区间格式里是两行：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>id</th>\n<th>start</th>\n<th>stop</th>\n<th>dose</th>\n<th>event</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种格式下，<a href=\"../models/cox-proportional-hazards\">Cox 比例风险模型</a> 的部分似然依然成立——只是在每个事件时刻构造风险集时，每个个体用的是它「在该时刻所处区间」的协变量值。模型形式变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">β</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(t\\mid\\mathbf{x}(t))=h_0(t)\\exp(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}^\\top\\mathbf{x}(t))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1834em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.034em;\">β</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9334em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，协变量带上了时间依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内生还是外生-一个致命区分\">内生还是外生：一个致命区分</h2><p>时变协变量分两类，混淆它们会导致严重的因果错误，这是本篇最关键的警告。</p>\n<p>外生（外部）协变量的变化独立于个体的事件进程，比如随日期变化的空气污染指数、随时间推进的累计治疗周数。它们可以放心地用扩展 Cox 建模。</p>\n<p>内生（内部）协变量则由个体自身状态产生，且与即将发生的事件高度纠缠——比如一个不断恶化的生物标志物，它的升高本身就是「快要发生事件」的征兆。把这种内生协变量直接放进 Cox 模型，会产生反向因果：你以为在预测事件，其实是在用「事件的前兆」解释事件，得到的系数严重失真。处理内生协变量需要联合模型（joint model，同时建模纵向标志物轨迹与生存）或下面要讲的地标分析，而不是朴素的时变 Cox。</p>\n<p>下表对比两类协变量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>变化来源</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>能否直接放进时变 Cox</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>外生</td>\n<td>独立于个体进程</td>\n<td>空气污染、累计周数、季节</td>\n<td>可以</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内生</td>\n<td>个体自身状态、与事件纠缠</td>\n<td>恶化中的生物标志物、肿瘤大小</td>\n<td>不行，需联合模型/地标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"左截断共用同一套格式\">左截断共用同一套格式</h2><p>计数过程格式还顺手解决了 <a href=\"../foundations/censoring-truncation\">删失与截断</a> 里提到的左截断（延迟进入）。一个在 60 岁才入组的样本，只需让它的第一行从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>start</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{start}}=60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">start</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 开始——它就只会在 60 岁之后才进入风险集，自动避免了「用没观测到的早期当作存活」的高估偏倚。</p>\n<p>这就是为什么左截断和时变协变量在工具层面常被一起处理：二者都靠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>start</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>stop</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t_{\\text{start}}, t_{\\text{stop}}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">start</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 这套区间数据表达。lifelines 的 <code>CoxTimeVaryingFitter</code> 与 R 的 <code>survival::coxph</code> 配合 <code>Surv(start, stop, event)</code> 都原生支持。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from lifelines import CoxTimeVaryingFitter&#10;&#10;# df_long: 含 id, start, stop, event 及时变协变量列&#10;ctv = CoxTimeVaryingFitter()&#10;ctv.fit(df_long, id_col=&quot;id&quot;, start_col=&quot;start&quot;,&#10;        stop_col=&quot;stop&quot;, event_col=&quot;event&quot;)&#10;ctv.print_summary()&#10;&#10;# 把宽格式转长格式的工具&#10;from lifelines.utils import to_long_format, add_covariate_to_timeline\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lifelines </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CoxTimeVaryingFitter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># df_long: 含 id, start, stop, event 及时变协变量列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CoxTimeVaryingFitter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctv.fit(df_long, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id_col</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start_col</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        stop_col</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stop\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event_col</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"event\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctv.print_summary()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 把宽格式转长格式的工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lifelines.utils </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> to_long_format, add_covariate_to_timeline</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"地标分析-另一条稳健路线\">地标分析：另一条稳健路线</h2><p>当时变协变量是内生的、或者你想做「在某个时间点之后的预测」时，地标分析（landmark analysis）是一种简单而稳健的替代方案。</p>\n<p>它的做法是：选定一个地标时刻（如随访第 90 天），只纳入活到该时刻的个体，用「截至地标时刻为止」的协变量值，预测「从地标往后」的生存。因为只用了地标之前的信息预测地标之后的结局，它从设计上杜绝了用未来信息预测过去的泄漏。地标分析特别适合动态预测场景——每隔一段时间用最新数据刷新预测，深度学习里 <a href=\"../models/ml-survival\">机器学习生存模型</a> 提到的 Dynamic-DeepHit 本质上是地标思想的神经网络版。</p>\n<p>地标分析也是规避不朽时间偏倚的有力武器——这种偏倚常因「按一个只有活到后期才能确定的状态分组」而产生，其机理与诊断见 <a href=\"pitfalls-validation\">陷阱与验证</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时变协变量用计数过程（区间）格式表达：每人多行，每行是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>start</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>stop</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t_{\\text{start}},t_{\\text{stop}}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">start</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 区间内的协变量值与是否发生事件。</li>\n<li>扩展 Cox <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">β</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(t\\mid\\mathbf{x}(t))=h_0(t)\\exp(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}^\\top\\mathbf{x}(t))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1834em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.034em;\">β</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9334em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 在该格式下成立，风险集按当前区间的协变量值构造。</li>\n<li>致命区分：外生协变量可直接建模；内生协变量（与事件纠缠的自身状态）会造成反向因果，需联合模型或地标分析。</li>\n<li>左截断（延迟进入）共用同一区间格式，只需让首行从进入时刻开始，自动避免早期生存高估。</li>\n<li>地标分析：只用地标前信息预测地标后结局，稳健、防泄漏，是动态预测与规避不朽时间偏倚的利器。</li>\n<li>工具：lifelines 的 <code>CoxTimeVaryingFitter</code>、R 的 <code>Surv(start, stop, event)</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时变协变量","id":"时变协变量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"内生还是外生：一个致命区分","id":"内生还是外生-一个致命区分"},{"level":2,"text":"左截断共用同一套格式","id":"左截断共用同一套格式"},{"level":2,"text":"地标分析：另一条稳健路线","id":"地标分析-另一条稳健路线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"竞争风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/practice/competing-risks"},"next":{"title":"陷阱与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/practice/pitfalls-validation"}}